# A GLIDE OFF A DROP DEEPER THAN THE WING FALLS (AbilityMotion.FALL_OUT): its six
# seconds run out still in the air, and the body falls out of the wing the rest
# of the way down, never put on the ground in one frame.
#   tools/tour.sh tours/glide_fall.tour --seed=1 --hour=11 --weather=clear:0 --fit=glide_wing
# tests/gear/test_abilities.gd measures the fall frame by frame; these are what
# it looks like: on the lip, gliding high, falling out after the seconds, down.
coast calm
place cliff
ledge glide
wait 0.8
shot 01-on-the-lip
tap ability_glide
await ability:glide 3
wait 3.0
shot 02-gliding-high with gliding
await falling_out 6
shot 03-falling-out-of-the-wing with falling_out
wait 1.6
shot 04-down
